     <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Frequency and duration of temperature excursions in assets with remote data loggers that can be detected through SMILE
- Maintained and improved data security, quality and integration of SMILE with the National One Data System for COVID-19
- Active users (% 78 out of total users), Measurement of timeliness of data

Data source: SMILE dashboard reporting system, Training result Report</narrative>
